# ==============================================================================
# HNSW vector index artifacts (v0.7.0 Phase 7)
# ==============================================================================
# Persisted under ~/.gemma-code/<workspace-id>/memory.hnsw at runtime; never
# committed. The pattern below catches any stray local copies.
*.hnsw
memory.hnsw
